  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multimodal multiprofile models (e.g., config_037) outperform single-modality baselines, but uncertainty remains about the relative impact of RNA encoder quality versus image encoder choices. This experiment tests a multimodal multiprofile setup using pca_n2000 RNA encoder (lower-performing in singleprofile) with resnet50 image encoder and avgpool aggregation, comparing it to config_031 (scvi_n200 + resnet50). This isolates the RNA encoder's contribution while keeping image encoder and aggregation consistent, helping determine if RNA encoder quality is the key factor driving performance in multiprofile settings."
}

